Grammar

    0 $accept: transformgraph "end file"

    1 transformgraph: kernellist activenode

    2 activenode: ACTIVE id SEMICOL

    3 kernellist: kernel kernellist
    4           | ε

    5 kernel: DTL id inputlistwrapper ASSIGN LCURLY program RCURLY

    6 inputlistwrapper: COLON inputlist
    7                 | ε

    8 inputlist: id COMMA inputlist
    9          | id

   10 program: constdecls forstatement

   11 constdecls: constdecls constdecl
   12           | constdecls metadatastreamdecl
   13           | ε

   14 metadatastreamdecl: METADATASTREAM LESS intlit COMMA intlit GREATER id SEMICOL
   15                   | METADATASTREAM LESS intlit COMMA id GREATER id SEMICOL

   16 constdecl: type id ASSIGN intlit SEMICOL
   17          | NOPT type id ASSIGN intlit SEMICOL
   18          | type id ASSIGN LCURLY intlist RCURLY SEMICOL

   19 intlist: intlit COMMA intlist
   20        | intlit
   21        | ε

   22 forstatement: FOR LPAREN constdecl expr SEMICOL unarystmt RPAREN LCURLY forstatement RCURLY
   23             | FOR LPAREN constdecl expr SEMICOL unarystmt RPAREN LCURLY innernest RCURLY

   24 outstatements: outstatements outstatement
   25              | outstatement

   26 innernest: outstatements
   27          | ifstatement
   28          | switchstatement

   29 ifstatement: IF LPAREN ISEVEN id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   30            | IF LPAREN id LESS id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   31            | IF LPAREN id LESSEQUAL id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   32            | IF LPAREN id GREATER id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   33            | IF LPAREN id GREATEREQUAL id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   34            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   35            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id OR ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   36            | IF LPAREN ISEDGE id AND ISEDGE id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY
   37            | IF LPAREN PAD id id id id RPAREN LCURLY outstatements RCURLY ELSE LCURLY outstatements RCURLY

   38 switchstatement: SWITCH LPAREN id RPAREN LCURLY casestatements RCURLY

   39 casestatements: casestatement casestatements
   40               | casestatement

   41 casestatement: CASE COLON outstatements

   42 outstatement: OUT ASSIGN expr SEMICOL

   43 type: INT

   44 expr: expr CROSS expr
   45     | expr LESS expr
   46     | expr STAR expr
   47     | expr MINUS expr
   48     | term

   49 unarystmt: loc POSTINC

   50 term: factor
   51     | LPAREN expr RPAREN

   52 factor: intlit
   53       | loc

   54 intlit: INTLITERAL

   55 loc: id
   56    | id LBRACKET id RBRACKET

   57 id: ID


